  "details": "VRChat spawns a VRCCam prefab when uploading a world thumbnail.\nCurrently, we need to configure that camera ourselves. Enable HDR, add post processing, etc.\nBut... didn't we already add those to the reference camera?\n**Prososal: When uploading a thumbnail, the SDK should re-use what's on the reference camera.**\nThis could be accomplished by copying the camera's settings and components to VRCCam. Alternatively, the SDK could simply use the reference camera, instead of spawning the VRCCam prefab.",
